# QA M5 flow (D-047 carry-over, D-081): Zuckerschock Resi carried from
# St. Wolfgang into the Wolfgangsee. qa_m4_flow_st_wolfgang_hackl_to_
# wolfgangsee (title flow, the relaxed St. Wolfgang run with the Hackl),
# but at stand #3 she does not hop its snow globe (5177): it hits her as
# Hackl -> Zuckerschock (Hurt at 5215, the 30-frame freeze), then she
# walks on to where the original run hops the next globe and follows it
# to the Maibaum (clear at 5534, as Zuckerschock). The route map waits,
# the Wolfgangsee intro draws her big, and play starts on the St.
# Wolfgang quay as Zuckerschock with score, lives and Oblaten kept. There
# she walks to the bollard, hops it and drops into the bathing notch,
# where she floats as Zuckerschock (swimming, top 186).
level  = st_wolfgang
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=5534..5534 deaths=0 event=Hurt
expect = state=playing stage=wolfgangsee power=big lives=3 swimming=true player_y>=184 player_y<=191
